ill be limited to** two minutes.","**Much as** they value candour, they know when to **concede** a point, **albeit** briefly, and they never **walk back** their central claim. The visible speech is **the tip of the iceberg**; it rests on listening, drafting and rehearsal."],"kicker":"PRESS NOTE","by":"Public Speaking Forum","gloss":[["craft","ofício"],["candour","franqueza"],["courteous","cortês"],["exact","preciso"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Good speakers avoid pauses.","ans":"F","why":"pause before the line."},{"q":"Their invitations are courteous.","ans":"T","why":"we should be honoured."},{"q":"The visible speech is the whole job.","ans":"F","why":"tip of the iceberg."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“albeit” = ?","opts":["embora","além disso","porém só"],"ans":0,"why":"albeit."},{"q":"“know their craft” = ?","opts":["dominam o ofício","conhecem o artesanato","gostam de arte"],"ans":0,"why":"craft = ofício."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verifique","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Uso **recursos retóricos**?","tricolon, anáfora, antítese"],["Escrevo **convites formais**?","**Should you be unable to** attend…; **We should be honoured**"],["Redijo **avisos públicos**?","**will be limited to**, **Please note**"],["Concedo com **much as / albeit / be that as it may**?","**Much as** I admire…"],["Uso **the tip of the iceberg / draw the line**?","The text is **the tip of the iceberg**"]],"cap":"Autoavaliação da Unidade 6 (C2)"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ as I might, I can’t answer every email. (try)","a":"Try","why":"try as I might."},{"s":"___ has a play held an audience so tightly. (rarely)","a":"Rarely","why":"inversão."},{"s":"Tomás tapped his glass and the room ___ . (hush)","a":"hushed","why":"pretérito."},{"s":"Citizens lose benefits not because they are ineligible ___ because they cannot decode the form. (but)","a":"but","why":"not… but."},{"s":"The data ___ that audiences infer agreement. (suggest)","a":"suggest","why":"dados."},{"s":"A hook earns attention in the first fifteen ___ . (seconds)","a":"seconds","why":"substantivo."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["rookie ward member","membro novato do distrito"],["email backlog","acúmulo de e-mails"],["constituent inbox","caixa de entrada de eleitores"],["urgent reply","resposta urgente"],["flooded estate","conjunto alagado"],["run-off culvert","bueiro de escoamento"]]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Unit word bank","blocks":[{"type":"words","items":[["rookie ward member","membro novato do distrito"],["email backlog","acúmulo de e-mails"],["constituent inbox","caixa de entrada de eleitores"],["urgent reply","resposta urgente"],["flooded estate","conjunto alagado"],["run-off culvert","bueiro de escoamento"],["gutter clearance","limpeza de calhas"],["resident warning","aviso aos moradores"],["vehicle relocation","remoção de veículos"],["damage limitation plan","plano de contenção de danos"],["flood preparedness","preparo para enchentes"],["drainage capacity","capacidade de drenagem"],["weekend site visit","visita de fim de semana ao local"],["humble governance","governança humilde"],["promise fatigue","cansaço de promessas"],["unheard resident","morador não ouvido"],["council workload","carga de trabalho do conselho"],["ward surgery","plantão de atendimento ao distrito"],["casework","atendimento de casos"],["candid reflection","reflexão franca"],["term limit","limite de mandato"],["honeymoon period","lua de mel política"],["steep apprenticeship","aprendizado íngreme"],["modest victory","pequena vitória conquistada"],["statecraft play","peça de bastidores do poder"],["cabinet minister","ministra de gabinete"],["pre-broadcast tension","tensão pré-transmissão"],[